We use the sequence-to-sequence model [ Sutskever et al . 2014 ] with attention [ Bahdanau et al . 2014 ;
Jean et al . 2015 ; Luong et al . 2015 ; Mi et al . 2016 ] as the Baseline . Both the encoder and decoder
are based on the single layer LSTM [ Hochreiter and Schmidhuber 1997 ].
